    "title": "Bat Tests Positive for Rabies - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Admin ,\n1 days ago A live bat found on 8th Street in the Eloise area of Winter Haven has tested positive for rabies, marking Polk County’s sixth confirmed animal rabies case of 2026. The Incident: On Thursday, September 10, a resident picked up an animal in her yard after mistaking it for a mouse, only to realize it was a live bat. Read full article",
